        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: UFO Magazine\n- People: Nancy Hayfield, Charles Fort\n- Concepts: unidentified flying objects, extraterrestrial hypothesis, paranormal subjects, Fortean subjects, Fortean, Forteana\n\nFacts:\n- UFO Magazine was an American magazine devoted to unidentified flying objects, the extraterrestrial hypothesis, paranormal subjects, and Fortean subjects.\n- The terms Fortean and Forteana are sometimes used to characterize various anomalous phenomena associated with Charles Fort.\n- Nancy Hayfield was the last editor-in-chief of UFO Magazine when the magazine ceased publication.",
